1
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:07,334
Whiskers and the Wishing Coin.

2
00:00:17,615 --> 00:00:21,516
One sunny morning, a postcard blew in through the window.

3
00:00:21,716 --> 00:00:24,160
Hey! Who throws mail at a sleeping cat?

4
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:26,099
Whiskers, look! It's from Rome!

5
00:00:32,502 --> 00:00:36,152
It says: toss a coin in the Trevi Fountain, and your wish comes true.

6
00:00:36,352 --> 00:00:38,861
Rome? Isn't that where pizza comes from?

7
00:00:39,061 --> 00:00:41,692
Pizza, gelato, and wishes! Let's go!

8
00:00:46,544 --> 00:00:49,493
Wait! Take my lucky coin, and make a wish for me too!

9
00:00:49,693 --> 00:00:52,953
We will, Pip. I'll keep it safe, right here on my collar.

10
00:00:56,254 --> 00:01:00,799
So the two cats hopped on the morning train, all the way to Italy.

11
00:01:08,753 --> 00:01:10,031
Are we there yet?

12
00:01:10,231 --> 00:01:11,096
Not yet.

13
00:01:15,173 --> 00:01:16,467
How about now?

14
00:01:16,667 --> 00:01:18,215
Whiskers! Look outside!

15
00:01:26,169 --> 00:01:31,121
Past olive groves and umbrella pines, the train rolled into Rome.

16
00:01:41,401 --> 00:01:44,397
Narrow streets, flower boxes, and so many smells!

17
00:01:44,597 --> 00:01:47,113
Mostly pizza smells. I approve.

18
00:01:53,516 --> 00:01:55,993
Whoa! Who taught that bicycle to roar?

19
00:01:56,193 --> 00:01:58,893
Ha! That is a Vespa, my friends. Welcome to Rome!

20
00:02:02,195 --> 00:02:05,871
I am Nico, the best tour guide in the city. And I work for crumbs.

21
00:02:06,071 --> 00:02:08,984
We're looking for the Trevi Fountain. We have a wish to make!

22
00:02:09,184 --> 00:02:11,919
Ah, the fountain! Follow me. But first, a little tour!

23
00:02:24,526 --> 00:02:27,502
Behold! The Colosseum! Almost two thousand years old!

24
00:02:27,702 --> 00:02:30,672
A giant cheese grater, with a bite out of it!

25
00:02:30,872 --> 00:02:33,383
Whiskers, climb up there. You look like a hero!

26
00:02:40,562 --> 00:02:43,423
Hero of Rome! Now, which way to lunch?

27
00:02:52,152 --> 00:02:56,379
In a little piazza, Rosa the cat was spinning pizza dough.

28
00:02:56,579 --> 00:02:58,444
Ciao, little travellers! Hungry?

29
00:02:58,644 --> 00:03:00,869
Signora, I was born hungry.

30
00:03:11,149 --> 00:03:14,778
I meant to do that. Pizza hats are very fashionable.

31
00:03:14,978 --> 00:03:17,256
Bravo! Then you get the very first slice.

32
00:03:25,210 --> 00:03:27,966
Now, to the fountain, before the sun goes down!

33
00:03:38,247 --> 00:03:40,056
Ecco! The Trevi Fountain!

34
00:03:40,256 --> 00:03:42,405
It's even more beautiful than the postcard.

35
00:03:47,257 --> 00:03:49,214
Oh no. Pip's coin. It's gone!

36
00:03:49,414 --> 00:03:52,398
It was his lucky coin. I promised to keep it safe.

37
00:03:57,250 --> 00:03:59,267
Wait here. I know where it is.

38
00:03:59,467 --> 00:04:03,926
And Whiskers, the laziest cat in the world, ran all the way back.

39
00:04:20,797 --> 00:04:23,685
Found it. It was baked into my second slice.

40
00:04:23,885 --> 00:04:27,806
So I had to eat the whole pizza to find it. On purpose.

41
00:04:28,006 --> 00:04:31,083
Oh, Whiskers. You ran all that way, for me and Pip.

42
00:04:35,935 --> 00:04:39,303
Now turn around, and toss it over your shoulder. The Roman way!

43
00:04:48,033 --> 00:04:49,541
What did you wish for, Whiskers?

44
00:04:49,741 --> 00:04:51,353
A nap. And more pizza.

45
00:04:54,655 --> 00:04:57,564
And that one day, we come back here with Pip.

46
00:04:57,764 --> 00:04:59,617
That's exactly what I wished for too.

47
00:04:59,817 --> 00:05:02,278
Arrivederci, my friends! Come back soon!

48
00:05:07,906 --> 00:05:12,059
Two days later, the train brought two tired cats home again.

49
00:05:17,687 --> 00:05:19,479
You're back! Did you make the wish?

50
00:05:19,679 --> 00:05:21,873
We did. And Whiskers brought you something.

51
00:05:25,950 --> 00:05:29,040
Real Roman pizza. I only ate half of it.

52
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,667
Best present ever!

53
00:05:35,519 --> 00:05:39,223
That night, three friends dreamed of fountains and pizza.

54
00:05:39,423 --> 00:05:43,169
Because a wish is sweetest, when you make it for a friend.

